From: gennro <gennro2004@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:07:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] source: add an evdev motion sensor source

Reads evdev motion sensors (INPUT_PROP_ACCELEROMETER, ID_INPUT_ACCELEROMETER):
ABS_X/Y/Z acceleration and ABS_RX/RY/RZ angular velocity in the kernel's
motion sensor frame, scaled by each axis resolution, into Accelerometer and
Gyroscope events in Steam Deck units and axis order, the inverse of the
kernel's hid-steam mapping. For sensors without a kernel driver that a
userspace daemon exposes through uinput (Kettle Linux: kettle-motiond, for
the Qualcomm Sensor Core motion sensors on AYN handhelds), so its virtual
device, "Kettle Motion Sensors", joins the virtual device whitelist.
